# handle-hover-move (h7-plane): the pointer from the diamond straight onto
# the square in ONE move: the index change fires the diamond's hover-end
# after the square's hover (the TS order), so hovering is false — cursor
# pan — while a and b light and h and k do not. A stepped move would
# re-hover; the single jump is the state.
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
query func=x2&a=2&h=1&k=-3
wait 500
move 978 640
wait 300
move 1028 540
wait 300
shot handle-hover-move
